index b07e17d5495..9dc688dd21c 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -15,6 +15,10 @@ Docs: https://docs.openclaw.ai
 
 ### Fixes
 
+- Alert watcher: recover persisted classification and suggestion results after restart, retain per-call billing, and prevent automatic retries of uncertain sends. (#356) Thanks @NikolasP98.
+- Alert watcher: expire retained source, reply and queue payloads before recovery delivery while preserving duplicate-prevention records. (#356) Thanks @NikolasP98.
+- Cron: validate explicit agent and session bindings when jobs are added, updated and executed so invalid targets cannot fall back to another agent. (#356) Thanks @NikolasP98.
+
 - Agents: explain unavailable Hub tools, stop discovery loops with bounded recovery, and keep malformed model control markup out of chat and reasoning. Preserve browser and canvas action labels in tool summaries. (#338) Thanks @NikolasP98.
 
 - Agents: discover current authorized Hub queries, load tools within the same run, and stop repeated unproductive calls with a final explanation. Preserve SDK prompt rules and report Hub failures accurately. (#333) Thanks @NikolasP98.
